- $y_{i,t}$: truck $i$ active in period $t$ (binary)
- $u_{i,t}$: truck $i$ started up at period $t$ (binary)
- $x_{i,t}$: weight transported by truck $i$ in period $t$ (continuous, $\geq 0$)

